# Evidence audit

Audit public claims against the injected evidence/card service. The host
runtime invokes the compatibility dispatcher with the exact command name
`evidence-audit`; it does not read a transcript or private ledger.

Fixed control boundary:

`${PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/launch.sh control codex`

The source seam is:

`opensocrates.application.compatibility.dispatch_compatibility("evidence-audit", services=...)`
